CM EFQW_40M.NEC — End-Fed Quarter-Wave Vertical, 40 Meters
CM TM-EF-NEC-003 Rev A
CM
CM Band:       40m (7.000 – 7.300 MHz)
CM Center:     7.150 MHz
CM QW length:  10.18 m (VF=0.97, #18 AWG)
CM Feed Z:     35 + j0 Ω (perfect ground); 40 + j5 Ω (avg, 4 radials)
CM Radials:    4× 10.18m at ground level (or elevated 0.5m)
CM Matching:   L=0.524uH (7T T50-2), C=390pF + 0-82pF variable
CM
CM Portable notes: Can elevate the entire antenna 1-2m using
CM   a fiberglass pole for improved takeoff angle.
CM   Sloped at 45° drops feedpoint impedance slightly to ~30Ω.

